<ProjectLayout
  title="KM-RoBoTa"
  category="Experience | Robotics R&D"
  year="June 2025 | Sept 2025"
  description="Robotics and R&D engineering experience at KM-RoBoTa in Lausanne, focused on biomimetic quadruped architecture, lightweight joints and ROS2-supported validation."
>

  <p slot="intro">
    A robotics R&D experience focused on biomimetic mechanical architectures,
    lightweight joints and the integration of mechanical design with intelligent
    validation tools.
  </p>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      01
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Context
      </h2>

      <p>
        I joined KM-RoBoTa in Lausanne as a Robotics / R&D Engineer,
        working on the development of lightweight biomimetic robotic systems.
      </p>

      <p>
        The work combined mechanical architecture, joint design,
        structural optimisation and robotics validation.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      02
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Biomimetic quadruped
      </h2>

      <p>
        I contributed to the design of a biomimetic quadruped robotic architecture
        with the objective of reducing structural mass while preserving and improving
        mechanical rigidity.
      </p>

      <p>
        The resulting architecture achieved a reported 20% reduction in structural mass
        together with increased rigidity.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      03
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Trunk and joint architecture
      </h2>

      <p>
        I developed a new type of trunk, hind-leg arrangement and joint architecture
        for the robot.
      </p>

      <p>
        The resulting system integrated 23 joints and was designed to improve
        the torque-to-weight ratio of the complete robotic structure.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      04
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Flexible robotic arm
      </h2>

      <p>
        I engineered lightweight flexible arm joint systems intended to reproduce
        a wider and more human-like range of motion.
      </p>

      <p>
        The resulting architecture increased the reported range of motion by 75%,
        bringing the mechanical behaviour closer to the range achievable by a human arm.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      05
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Validation & ROS2
      </h2>

      <p>
        I developed AI-supported validation rigs using ROS2 to accelerate
        the evaluation of robotic concepts and reduce testing cycles.
      </p>

      <p>
        This work connected mechanical prototyping with software-assisted validation
        and helped establish a more efficient development loop between design,
        testing and iteration.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>


