  <section class="detail-section">

    <div class="detail-index">
      07
    </div>

    <div class="detail-copy">

      <h2>
        Perspective
      </h2>

      <p>
        This experience reinforced my interest in robotics where intelligence
        is not only implemented through software, but also embedded directly
        in the mechanical architecture of the system.
      </p>

      <p>
        It strengthened my interest in biomimetic structures, compliant mechanisms,
        lightweight robotics and the design of bodies whose geometry and mechanics
        contribute directly to their behaviour.
      </p>

    </div>

